@ddd.aggregate

Purpose:
  Consistency boundary.

UseWhen:
  - invariant spans multiple objects
  - atomic consistency is required
  - complex business rules exist

AvoidWhen:
  - simple CRUD
  - no business invariant
  - single entity operation

Why:
  Prevents unrelated objects from participating in the same consistency boundary.

Related:
  @ddd.entity
  @ddd.value-object
  @ddd.repository

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
